  {
    "tag": "span",
    "text": "How do retainers actually work?",
    "fontFamily": "",
    "textColor": "rgb(255, 255, 255)"
  },
  {
    "tag": "p",
    "text": "Think of it as having a dedicated designer on your team for a flat monthly rate. You get a set numbe",
    "fontFamily": "",
    "textColor": "rgb(184, 184, 184)"
  },
  {
    "tag": "span",
    "text": "What if I don't use all my hours?",
    "fontFamily": "",
    "textColor": "rgb(184, 184, 184)"
  },
  {
    "tag": "p",
    "text": "Unused hours roll over to the next month (up to 25% of your plan). This gives you flexibility during",
    "fontFamily": "",
    "textColor": "rgb(184, 184, 184)"
  },
  {
    "tag": "span",
    "text": "How fast can you start?",
    "fontFamily": "",
    "textColor": "rgb(184, 184, 184)"
  },
  {
    "tag": "p",
    "text": "For retainers, we can typically kick off within 3-5 business days. Project work usually begins withi",
    "fontFamily": "",
    "textColor": "rgb(184, 184, 184)"
  },
  {
    "tag": "span",
    "text": "Who will be working on my account?",
    "fontFamily": "",
    "textColor": "rgb(184, 184, 184)"
  },
  {
    "tag": "p",
    "text": "Every account is led by a senior designer with 10+ years of experience. For larger retainers and pro",
    "fontFamily": "",
    "textColor": "rgb(184, 184, 184)"
  },
  {
    "tag": "span",
    "text": "Can I switch between retainers and projects?",
    "fontFamily": "",
    "textColor": "rgb(184, 184, 184)"
  },
  {
    "tag": "p",
    "text": "Absolutely. Many clients use retainers for ongoing needs and projects for major initiatives. Retaine",
    "fontFamily": "",
    "textColor": "rgb(184, 184, 184)"
  },
  {
    "tag": "span",
    "text": "What's included in \"unlimited revisions\"?",
    "fontFamily": "",
    "textColor": "rgb(184, 184, 184)"
  },
  {
    "tag": "p",
    "text": "For retainer work, we'll refine until you're happy. For projects, we include two formal revision rou",
    "fontFamily": "",
    "textColor": "rgb(184, 184, 184)"
  },
  {
    "tag": "span",
    "text": "Do you work with international clients?",
    "fontFamily": "",
    "textColor": "rgb(184, 184, 184)"
  },
  {
    "tag": "p",
    "text": "Yes! About 40% of our clients are outside North America. We structure our days to overlap with diffe",
    "fontFamily": "",
    "textColor": "rgb(184, 184, 184)"
  },
  {
    "tag": "span",
    "text": "What if we need to pause or cancel?",
    "fontFamily": "",
    "textColor": "rgb(184, 184, 184)"
  },
  {
    "tag": "p",
    "text": "Life happens. You can pause or cancel your retainer with 30 days notice. When you're ready to return",
    "fontFamily": "",
    "textColor": "rgb(184, 184, 184)"
  },
